msgid ""
"Fighters are quick, agile ships that do not do a lot of damage, but usually "
"come in larger groups. They are easy to take out, but should not be "
"underestimated. The Fighter II is a more powerful version with stronger "
"beams, hull and shields and an added homing missile tube. All those "
"additions make it a bit slower, though.\n"
"\n"
"Give your science database librarian a big smile. She works hard for you."
