#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2347
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Small, medium and large scale transport ships. These are the working ships "
"that keep commerce going in any sector. They may carry personnel, goods, "
"cargo, equipment, garbage, fuel, research material, etc."
msgstr "Small, medium and large scale transport ships. These are the working ships that keep commerce going in any sector. They may carry personnel, goods, cargo, equipment, garbage, fuel, research material, etc."

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2370
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Personnel Jump Freighter 3"
msgstr "Personnel Jump Freighter 3"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2383
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Space Sedan was built around a surplus Personnel Jump Freighter 3. It's "
"designed to provide relatively low cost transportation primarily for people, "
"but there is also a limited amount of cargo space available"
msgstr "The Space Sedan was built around a surplus Personnel Jump Freighter 3. It's designed to provide relatively low cost transportation primarily for people, but there is also a limited amount of cargo space available"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2391
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Personnel Jump Freighter 5"
msgstr "Personnel Jump Freighter 5"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2404
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Omnibus was designed from the Personnel Jump Freighter 5. It's made to "
"transport large numbers of passengers of various types along with their "
"luggage and any associated cargo"
msgstr "The Omnibus was designed from the Personnel Jump Freighter 5. It's made to transport large numbers of passengers of various types along with their luggage and any associated cargo"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2412
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Equipment Jump Freighter 4"
msgstr "Equipment Jump Freighter 4"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2429
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Service Jonque is a modified Equipment Jump Freighter 4. It's designed "
"to carry spare parts and equipment as well as the necessary repair personnel "
"to where it's needed to repair stations and ships"
msgstr "The Service Jonque is a modified Equipment Jump Freighter 4. It's designed to carry spare parts and equipment as well as the necessary repair personnel to where it's needed to repair stations and ships"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2437
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Personnel Freighter 1"
msgstr "Personnel Freighter 1"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2450
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Courier is a souped up Personnel Freighter 1. It's made to deliver "
"people and messages fast. Very fast"
msgstr "The Courier is a souped up Personnel Freighter 1. It's made to deliver people and messages fast. Very fast"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2458
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Equipment Freighter 2"
msgstr "Equipment Freighter 2"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2471
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Work Wagon is a conversion of an Equipment Freighter 2 designed to carry "
"equipment and parts where they are needed for repair or construction."
msgstr "The Work Wagon is a conversion of an Equipment Freighter 2 designed to carry equipment and parts where they are needed for repair or construction."

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2479
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Goods Freighter 3"
msgstr "Goods Freighter 3"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2492
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"As a side contract, Conversion R Us put together the Laden Lorry from some "
"recently acquired Goods Freighter 3 hulls. The added warp drive makes for a "
"more versatile goods carrying vessel."
msgstr "As a side contract, Conversion R Us put together the Laden Lorry from some recently acquired Goods Freighter 3 hulls. The added warp drive makes for a more versatile goods carrying vessel."

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2500
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid "Garbage Freighter 3"
msgstr "Garbage Freighter 3"

#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:2513
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"Conversion R Us cleaned up and converted excess freighter hulls into Physics "
"Research vessels. The reduced weight improved the impulse speed and "
"maneuverability."
msgstr "Conversion R Us cleaned up and converted excess freighter hulls into Physics Research vessels. The reduced weight improved the impulse speed and maneuverability."

